ithout ever touching 10grand and they have raised beautiful and happy children, living a happy life with all they can afford to have having more than what people flexing online can have.", "timestamp": 1780731865, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "akinwoladeracheal", "author_id": "79181357532", "id": "17861245311637398", "text": "Reposting so they stop bringing babies into world to suffer. Get your finances and life in order before bringing a baby into this world", "timestamp": 1780678789, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "lbofficial001", "author_id": "52701096591", "id": "18175097608409019", "text": "Don't spread your poverty to the next generation, lol😂😂", "timestamp": 1780302493, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "shapeful.helie", "author_id": "50354736341", "id": "17931700755089504", "text": "True", "timestamp": 1780264819, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "lanamodela", "author_id": "40088736148", "id": "18110470540763825", "text": "That's why I'm struggling today instead of enjoying my youth age I have to struggle to make it up to my kids for bringing them so early God help us single mothers out there who are not looking for another man to correct our mistakes", "timestamp": 1780232637, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "_iammidecha", "author_id": "4261452091", "id": "18426917617120037", "text": "Facts!! 🙌", "timestamp": 1780219845, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "mc_alnajar23", "author_id": "1358085729", "id": "18119924431667325", "text": "Oh men why mr amer jamal al najjar", "timestamp": 1780139632, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "gura_so", "author_id": "49224699126", "id": "17883245388568444", "text": "Omor, Poor man dey really see something o", "timestamp": 1779460417, "like_count": 0}], "webpage_url": "https://www.instagram.com/reel/DWY17okjML4/?stkn=aHMwOTYwenFtZzRn", "webpage_url_basename": "DWY17okjML4", "webpage_url_domain": "instagram.com", "extractor": "Instagram", "extractor_key": "Instagram", "thumbnail": "https://scontent-bog2-2.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/657208501_18